[32m+[m[32m## Day 8 — Aug 28[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Done**[m
[32m+[m[32m- Made `renderPdfToImages` take `scale` as a parameter instead of hardcoding[m
[32m+[m[32m  it, and re-ran route B on Sonnet 5 instead of Haiku.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Findings — the important one**[m
[32m+[m[32m- Day 7's "vision is broken" conclusion was wrong in its framing: the failure[m
[32m+[m[32m  is model-tier specific, not inherent to the route. Sonnet 5 extracts the[m
[32m+[m[32m  same document at 100% field accuracy over vision. Haiku 4.5 is simply the[m
[32m+[m[32m  wrong tier for reading an image of a payroll table.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m  | Route                    | Accuracy | Determinism |[m
[32m+[m[32m  |---------------------------|----------|-------------------------------|[m
[32m+[m[32m  | A — text (Haiku 4.5)      | 100%     | identical output, 2 runs at temp 0 |[m
[32m+[m[32m  | B — vision (Haiku 4.5)    | catastrophic (misreads, hallucinated employee, schema violation) | different output, 2 runs at temp 0 |[m
[32m+[m[32m  | B — vision (Sonnet 5)     | 100%     | structured fields byte-identical, 3 runs (temp 0 unavailable — see below); `anomalies` prose varied every run |[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Separately: resolution was never the lever. `scale: 2` and `scale: 4`[m
[32m+[m[32m  produce identical input token counts (3,044 both times) despite the[m
[32m+[m[32m  rendered PNG genuinely differing per scale — 52 KB at scale 2 vs. 120 KB[m
[32m+[m[32m  at scale 4, confirmed by logging page size. So local rendering is working[m
[32m+[m[32m  correctly; the downsampling happens API-side, after upload. Raising render[m
[32m+[m[32m  scale burns local render time and bandwidth for nothing. Dropped the[m
[32m+[m[32m  scale-tuning idea entirely.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- `temperature: 0` is also absent from the Sonnet 5 vision call, but not by[m
[32m+[m[32m  choice: Sonnet 5 rejects the parameter outright with a 400 error. Removing[m
[32m+[m[32m  it was mandatory, not an oversight left over from debugging.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Ran the same Sonnet 5 vision extraction three times to settle Day 7's[m
[32m+[m[32m  non-determinism question on this tier. All 25 structured fields were[m
[32m+[m[32m  byte-identical across all three runs. The free-text `anomalies`[m
[32m+[m[32m  descriptions differed every time (output tokens: 796 / 808 / 811).[m
[32m+[m[32m  Design rule: never key, compare, or diff on model-generated prose — only[m
[32m+[m[32m  on schema fields. This is exactly why `anomalies` is excluded from[m
[32m+[m[32m  flatten/compare (see src/flatten.ts).[m
[32m+[m
